From 20af12ba14be1eaf6ee6cba0a5c6077bc53b0c9e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LG510S lab <lab@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:26:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] realtek: rtl930x: add Lianguo LG510S-4T2XS

Hardware: RTL9303, one RTL8264B quad 10G PHY on SMI bus 0 addresses 0-3
(SerDes 2-5, USXGMII), two SFP+ cages on SerDes 7/8 with SoC GPIO and
I2C master 1 (SCL GPIO 8, SDA GPIO 9/10), 128 MiB RAM, 16 MiB SPI NOR,
reset button on GPIO 5, SYS LED on GPIO 0, no fan controller.

The port LED configuration reproduces what the stock firmware programs,
so the LEDs work without U-Boot having initialised the switch.

Only the firmware partition is writable. Installation tested through
sysupgrade from a TFTP-loaded initramfs.
